### Jörmungandr API & Inference Microservice Workbench
### Test mock endpoints directly using the built-in HTTP Client

### 1. Test Model Health & Hardware Telemetry
GET http://127.0.0.1:8089/v1/models/telemetry
Accept: application/json

### 2. Generate Dense Embeddings
POST http://127.0.0.1:8089/v1/models/text-embedding/embed
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "inputs": [
    "High-throughput zero-copy columnar data processing",
    "Adversarial LLM evaluation and red-teaming benchmark"
  ],
  "normalize": true
}

### 3. Chat Completion Request (OpenAI / vLLM compatible)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8089/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "model": "meta-llama-3.1-8b-instruct",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are Jörmungandr Copilot, an expert AI pair-programmer."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What are the core features of the Jörmungandr IDE?"
    }
  ],
  "temperature": 0.2
}
